 "remarks": "HIGHEST AND BEST DUE TUESDAY 11/10/26 5 PM EST. Opportunity awaits at 4 Pemberwick Road in Greenwich. Situated in the R-6 zone, this single-family home offers exciting possibilities for expansion, renovation, an accessory dwelling unit (ADU), or potential two-family redevelopment, subject to town approvals. The existing home features two bedrooms, one bathroom, hardwood floors, a charming stone fireplace, and an unfinished basement offering ample storage. A detached two-car garage, generous driveway parking, and fenced front yard add to the property's appeal. Conveniently located near local shops, restaurants, parks, and transportation. An excellent opportunity for homeowners, builders, and investors looking to unlock the property's full potential. Sqft is architectural not FAR.",
